# Line endings
#
# Normalize every text file to LF, both in the repository and in the working
# tree. This deliberately overrides per-machine `core.autocrlf` (Git for
# Windows ships with `core.autocrlf=true` in its system config, and .git/config
# is not cloned, so a repo-local override protects only one checkout).
#
# Without `eol=lf`, a Windows checkout writes CRLF while Dart/Flutter codegen
# (`flutter gen-l10n`, `build_runner`, `dart format`) always writes LF. The
# resulting size mismatch makes Git's stat cache report those files as modified
# forever, even though `git diff` is empty and the blobs are identical.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never sniff or convert these.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.dic  binary
*.bin  binary
